          solution: ['Since the time period is the same for both, the ratio is simply the capital ratio: 8,000 : 12,000 = 2 : 3.', 'A’s share = (2/5) × 5,000 = ₹2,000. B’s share = (3/5) × 5,000 = ₹3,000.'],
